    "label": {
      "en": "Canarias GMI amount, 1 member family"
    },
    "short_label": {
      "en": "$bsarg_rg70_amt1"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This is the monthly Canarias Renta Canaria de Ciudadanía amount for a one-person household (733.60 EUR at the latest of 9 recorded values since 2016-01-01), identical to the equivalent Illes Balears constant ($bsarg_rg53_amt1) and above the country report's 2025 published figure of 658.81 EUR. This is consistent with the country report's statement that 'from 2023, the basic amounts were updated according [to] the guaranteed minimum income', i.e. Canarias' scheme converged onto the same national Ingreso Mínimo Vital scale as Illes Balears, and the constant's latest value likely reflects an uprating beyond the report's 2022-2025 table. It is used once in bsarg_es's BenCalc as the Comp_perTU parameter for '70 - Canarias: GMI amount'."
    },
